spice
* Example SPICE netlist

IREF 3 0 DC <value>   * Current source I_REF from net 3 to ground
MREF 3 3 0 0 <model>  * NMOS transistor M_REF with all terminals connected to net 3
M1 2 3 0 0 <model>    * NMOS transistor M1, with the gate at net 3, drain at 2, and source/bulk at 0
RP 2 0 <value>        * Resistor RP connected between net 2 and ground

VDD 3 0 DC <value>    * Supply voltage V_DD at net 3